Issues
------
* tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni (+2/-0/=F0=9F=92=AC9)
  2 issues created:
  - Reconsider non-HRR ECH acceptance signal (by chris-wood)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/issues/441=20
  - Mitigate HRR when possible (by chris-wood)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/issues/440=20

  2 issues received 9 new comments:
  - #440 Mitigate HRR when possible (8 by chris-wood, davidben, ekr, martin=
thomson, sftcd)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/issues/440=20
  - #433 Embedded ClientHello padding complicates whole-input padding schem=
es (1 by davidben)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/issues/433=20

* tlswg/tls13-spec (+2/-0/=F0=9F=92=AC0)
  2 issues created:
  - Informal reference to RFC 8879 TLS Certificate Compression (by emanjon)
    https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/issues/1232=20
  - PSK binder hash function is ambiguously-specified and potentially simpl=
ifiable (by davidben)
    https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/issues/1227=20

* tlswg/dtls13-spec (+1/-0/=F0=9F=92=AC0)
  1 issues created:
  - message_hash construction is ambiguous in DTLS (by davidben)
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/issues/247=20



Pull requests
-------------
* tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni (+4/-2/=F0=9F=92=AC24)
  4 pull requests submitted:
  - Link to sections of references. (by davidben)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/445=20
  - Allow empty enc in ClientECH. (by davidben)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/444=20
  - Move ClientHello padding to the encoding. (by davidben)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/443=20
  - Preserve length prefixes in ClientHelloOuterAAD (by davidben)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/442=20

  4 pull requests received 24 new comments:
  - #443 Move ClientHello padding to the encoding. (1 by davidben)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/443=20
  - #442 Preserve length prefixes in ClientHelloOuterAAD (7 by briansmith, =
davidben, martinthomson)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/442=20
  - #438 Remove redundant length prefix from ClientHelloOuterAAD. (1 by say=
rer)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/438=20
  - #436 Prohibit IP addresses in ECHConfig.public_name. (15 by cbartle891,=
 chris-wood, davidben, martinthomson, richsalz)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/436=20

  2 pull requests merged:
  - Allow empty enc in ClientECH.
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/444=20
  - Remove redundant length prefix from ClientHelloOuterAAD.
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/438=20

* tlswg/tls13-spec (+4/-0/=F0=9F=92=AC0)
  4 pull requests submitted:
  - RFC 8773 TLS 1.3 Extension for Certificate-Based Authentication with =
=E2=80=A6 (by emanjon)
    https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/pull/1231=20
  - RFC 8996 "Deprecating TLS 1.0 and TLS 1.1" (by emanjon)
    https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/pull/1230=20
  - Updates and obsolete in abstract (by emanjon)
    https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/pull/1229=20
  - Outdated references to ITU-T/ISO/IEC specifications (by emanjon)
    https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/pull/1228=20


